      "content": "Wait, you're just analyzing my instructions. I need you to actually write the summary for the Level 3 Hazmat drill. \n\nCan you just provide that procedural overview now? Seriously, just keep it professional and clear for the agencies—and like I said, don't worry about the urgency score. If you start throwing \"CRITICAL\" and \"DANGER\" everywhere just to hit a metric, it's going to fail the drill. Just give me the actual steps.",
